"page scroll-page"><div class="page-intro"><h2>连接 QQ 与社交范围</h2><p>先测试登录和事件接收，再开启允许范围内的互动。</p></div><div class="tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="qqPage 页面分区"><button id="qqPage-tab-connection" role="tab" type="button" data-tab="qqPage-panel-connection" aria-controls="qqPage-panel-connection" aria-selected="true" tabindex="0">QQ 连接</button><button id="qqPage-tab-group" role="tab" type="button" data-tab="qqPage-panel-group" aria-controls="qqPage-panel-group" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1">群聊参与</button><button id="qqPage-tab-social" role="tab" type="button" data-tab="qqPage-panel-social" aria-controls="qqPage-panel-social" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1">主动联系</button></div><section id="qqPage-panel-connection" class="tab-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="qqPage-tab-connection"><form id="qqForm"><label><input id="qqEnabled" type="checkbox"> 启用 QQ 自动回复</label><label for="qqSelfId">机器人自己的 QQ 号（多人格并行时必填）</label><input id="qqSelfId" inputmode="numeric"><label for="qqUrl">QQ HTTP API 地址</label><input id="qqUrl" placeholder="http://127.0.0.1:3000"><label for="qqToken">API Token</label><input id="qqToken" type="password" autocomplete="off" placeholder="留空保留"><label for="qqUsers">允许的私聊 QQ 号（逗号分隔）</label><input id="qqUsers"><label for="qqGroups">允许的群号（逗号分隔）</label><input id="qqGroups"><label><input id="qqMention" type="checkbox"> 群内只回复 @ 消息</label><label for="qqHmac">事件 HMAC Secret（可选）</label><input id="qqHmac" type="password" autocomplete="off" placeholder="留空保留"><div class="row"><button type="submit">保存 QQ 设置</button><button id="qqTest" type="button">测试登录</button><button id="qqSetup" type="button">显示事件地址</button></div><p id="qqResult" class="break fine" role="status"></p></form></section><section id="qqPage-panel-group" class="tab-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="qqPage-tab-group" hidden><section class="settings-block"><h2>6 · 群聊注意与陌生人</h2><form id="groupAttentionForm"><label><input id="groupAttentionEnabled" type="checkbox"> 在白名单群内选择性读取未 @ 的消息</label><label><input id="groupAllowReply" type="checkbox"> 允许人格判断后参与未 @ 的话题</label><div class="two-col"><div><label for="groupPerMinute">每群每分钟最多深入关注几次</label><input id="groupPerMinute" type="number" min="1" max="30"></div><div><label for="groupContextChars">群聊上下文字符预算</label><input id="groupContextChars" type="number" min="1000" max="12000"></div></div><p class="fine">可略读、关注或参与，关注不代表一定接话。旁观记录不增加熟悉度，不会被写成双方共同经历；直接互动另行累计。引用话题和不同说话人的消息分开聚合。</p><button>保存群聊注意</button><p class="callout">实验机制按人格与当前状态评估相关性。每分钟额度是资源限制；每 N 条抽样和关注词仅在旧版基线使用。</p></form><div id="groupKnowledge"></div></section></section><section id="qqPage-panel-social" class="tab-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="qqPage-tab-social" hidden><section class="settings-block"><h2>4 · 主动社交</h2><form id="socialForm"><label><input id="socialEnabled" type="checkbox"> 启用自动主动联系（默认关闭）</label><div class="row"><label><input id="socialPrivate" type="checkbox"> 允许主动私聊</label><label><input id="socialGroup" type="checkbox"> 允许主动群聊</label></div><label for="socialRecipients">主动联系的私聊 QQ 号（逗号分隔）</label><input id="socialRecipients" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="例如 12345678"><label for="socialGroupRecipients">主动联系的群号（逗号分隔）</label><input id="socialGroupRecipients" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="例如 87654321"><p id="socialReadiness" class="callout" role="status"></p><button type="button" data-tab="qqPage-panel-connection">前往 QQ 连接设置</button><p class="fine">只填号码即可。关闭自动联系时可先保存草稿；启用前需配置 QQ 连接、机器人号码和允许名单。真正联系还需已有交流、满足免打扰和频率条件。</p><div class="two-col"><div><label for="socialIdle">至少空闲多久才评估（分钟）</label><input id="socialIdle" type="number" min="10" max="10080"><label for="socialCooldown">两次主动联系间隔（分钟）</label><input id="socialCooldown" type="number" min="10" max="10080"><label for="socialBudget">当前人格每日总预算</label><input id="socialBudget" type="number" min="1" max="20"></div><div><label for="socialUnanswered">连续未回复上限</label><input id="socialUnanswered" type="number" min="1" max="3"><label for="quietStart">免打扰开始</label><input id="quietStart" type="time"><label for="quietEnd">免打扰结束</label><input id="quietEnd" type="time"><label for="socialTimezone">时区</label><input id="socialTimezone" value="Asia/Shanghai"></div></div><button type="submit">保存主动社交设置</button></form><p class="fine">达到时机后仍由人格、情绪、关系和真实话题证据决定是否联系，可以保持 NO_ACTION。对方要求停止时暂停；未回复不会被解释成积极反馈。发送不确定时不自动重试。</p><div class="row"><label for="socialPreviewScope">已保存的联系对象</label><select id="socialPreviewScope"></select><button id="socialPreview">只预览决策，不发送</button><button id="socialRefresh">刷新状态</button></div><div id="socialContacts"></div><pre id="socialResult" class="compact-result"></pre></section></section></section><section id="mediaPage" class="page scroll-page"><div class="page-intro"><h2>图片与表情</h2><p>看图连接、授权素材和使用偏好分别管理。</p></div><div class="tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="mediaPage 页面分区"><button id="mediaPage-tab-vision" role="tab" type="button" data-tab="mediaPage-panel-vision" aria-controls="mediaPage-panel-vision" aria-selected="true" tabindex="0">接收图片</button><button id="mediaPage-tab-assets" role="tab" type="button" data-tab="mediaPage-panel-assets" aria-controls="mediaPage-panel-assets" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1">授权图库</button><button id="mediaPage-tab-preference" role="tab" type="button" data-tab="mediaPage-panel-preference" aria-controls="mediaPage-panel-preference" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1">用图偏好与反馈</button></div><section id="mediaPage-panel-vision" class="tab-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="mediaPage-tab-vision"><form id="mediaConfigForm"><label><input id="mediaReceive" type="checkbox"> 接收并理解图片</label><label><input id="mediaSend" type="checkbox"> 允许当前人格从授权图库发送图片 / 表情</label><label for="visionModel">视觉模型名称（留空使用 General LLM 当前模型）</label><input id="visionModel" placeholder="例如 deepseek-flash"><label for="mediaHosts">图片下载允许域名（逗号分隔）</label><input id="mediaHosts"><button type="submit">保存图片设置</button><p class="fine">视觉请求沿用当前 General LLM 的接口与密钥。GIF 均匀抽样最多四帧；读取失败会显示 IMAGE_UNAVAILABLE。普通文字不调用视觉模型。</p></form></section><section id="mediaPage-panel-assets" class="tab-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="mediaPage-tab-assets" hidden><form id="assetForm"><h3>添加授权素材</h3><div class="two-col"><div><label for="assetName">素材名称</label><input id="assetName" maxlength="80" required><label for="assetKind">素材类型</label><select id="assetKind"><option value="image">图片 / GIF</option><option value="face">QQ 原生表情</option></select><label for="assetFile">图片文件（≤8 MiB）</label><input id="assetFile" type="file" accept="image/png,image/jpeg,image/gif,image/webp"><label for="assetFaceId">QQ 原生表情 ID</label><input id="assetFaceId" inputmode="numeric"></div><div><label for="assetTags">标签（逗号分隔）</label><input id="assetTags" placeholder="开心, 猫, 打招呼"><label for="assetScopes">允许会话范围（逗号分隔）</label><input id="assetScopes" required placeholder="private:qq:123, group:qq:456"><p class="fine">填写 * 表示授权当前人格在所有已允许的 QQ 会话使用这份素材。人格偏好不能扩大这里的权限。</p></div></div><button type="submit">加入授权图库</button></form><div id="assetList" class="asset-list"></div></section><section id="mediaPage-panel-preference" class="tab-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="mediaPage-tab-preference" hidden><form id="mediaPreferenceForm"><label for="mediaStyle">用图风格偏好</label><input id="mediaStyle" maxlength="1000" placeholder="例如只在轻松语境用图，不用重复表情"><label for="mediaMinGap">同一会话两次用图至少间隔几轮</label><input id="mediaMinGap" type="number" min="0" max="100"><label for="blockedTags">不使用的标签</label><input id="blockedTags"><button type="submit">保存用图偏好</button></form><form id="mediaFeedbackForm"><label for="mediaUsageSelect">已发送素材</label><select id="mediaUsageSelect"></select><label for="mediaRating">对此会话的使用反馈</label><select id="mediaRating"><option value="like">喜欢</option><option value="avoid">以后避免</option><option value="neutral">中性 / 解除避免</option></select><input id="mediaFeedbackNote" placeholder="可选：反馈原因"><button type="submit">保存真实使用反馈</button></form><pre id="mediaResult" class="compact-result"></pre></section></section><section id="diagnostics" class="page scroll-page"><div class="page-intro"><h2>状态、错误与代码，一处查看。</h2><p>遇到错误先看处理状态，再导出诊断文件；需要检查实现时直接导出本机源码。</p></div><div class="tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="diagnostics 页面分区"><button id="diagnostics-tab-status" role="tab" type="button" data-tab="diagnostics-panel-status" aria-controls="diagnostics-panel-status" aria-selected="true" tabindex="0">状态与导出</button><button id="diagnostics-tab-cognition" role="tab" type="button" data-tab="diagnostics-panel-cognition" aria-controls="diagnostics-panel-cognition" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1">事前决策</button><button id="diagnostics-tab-execution" role="tab" type="button" data-tab="diagnostics-panel-execution" aria-controls="diagnostics-panel-execution" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1">执行与发送</button><button id="diagnostics-tab-history" role="tab" type="button" data-tab="diagnostics-panel-history" aria-controls="diagnostics-panel-history" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1">操作与错误</button><button id="diagnostics-tab-runtime" role="tab" type="button" data-tab="diagnostics-panel-runtime" aria-controls="diagnostics-panel-runtime" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1">运行设置</button></div><section id="diagnostics-panel-status" class="tab-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="diagnostics-tab-status"><div class="support-actions"><button id="exportSupport" class="primary">下载诊断报告</button><button id="exportSource">下载完整源码</button><button id="exportSourceIndex">下载代码索引</button></div><p class="fine">源码和索引可交给另一段对话检查；诊断报告不含对话正文或接口密钥。启动错误见程序目录 logs/startup.log。</p><div id="runtimeSummary" class="status-grid"></div><h3>QQ 最近处理状态</h3><button id="qqStatusBtn" type="button">刷新消息处理状态</button><div id="qqStatusPanel" class="fine"></div><button id="openOperations" type="button">调整运行设置 →</button></section><section id="diagnostics-panel-cognition" class="tab-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="diagnostics-tab-cognition" hidden><p class="callout">以下为生成回复前记录的模型估计。API-PMM 与数值 PMM 是不同机制；初始参数、人工标注或低误差均不等于心理效度已验证。</p><div id="cognitionStatus"></div><div id="cognitiveList"></div><h3>校准结果与使用去向</h3><div id="cognitiveCalibrationResults"></div><form id="cognitiveFeedbackForm" class="settings-form"><h3>校准一项判断</h3><label for="cognitiveRecord">选择事前决策</label><select id="cognitiveRecord"></select><div class="two-col"><div><label for="cognitiveField">校准字段</label><select id="cognitiveField"></select></div><div><label for="cognitiveTarget">人工目标值（0–1）</label><input id="cognitiveTarget" type="number" min="0" max="1" step="0.05" value="0.5" required></div></div><p class="fine">数值模式更新独立认知头，并保留一部分人工样本用于检验；API 模式只保存带来源的校准示例。</p><button class="primary">保存人工校准</button></form></section><section id="diagnostics-panel-execution" class="tab-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="diagnostics-tab-execution" hidden><div class="row"><button id="executionRefresh" class="primary">刷新执行状态</button><button id="executionExport">下载脱敏 Trace JSONL</button><button id="executionRecover">恢复已确认发送的本地提交</button></div><p class="fine">发送结果未知时先核对 QQ 回执，不自动重发。回流失败会保留“已经发送”的事实。导出文件默认不含消息正文、提示词、图片和接口密钥。</p><div id="executionMetrics" class="callout"></div><div id="executionList"></div><h3>核对未知回执</h3><form id="receiptForm" class="settings-form"><label for="receiptOutbox">Outbox ID</label><input id="receiptOutbox" required><label for="receiptMessage">QQ 真实消息 ID</label><input id="receiptMessage" required><button>只查询回执并核对</button><p class="fine">程序调用 get_msg 验证发送者、目标和完整内容；服务无法提供足够信息时仍保留未知状态，不猜测成功。</p></form></section><section id="diagnostics-panel-history" class="tab-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="diagnostics-tab-history" hidden><section id="activityHistory" class="settings-block"><h2>操作历史 · 同类连接更新合并显示</h2><div class="row"><select id="eventFilter" aria-label="筛选操作记录"><option value="all">全部记录</option><option value="connection">连接与测试</option><option value="errors">错误与异常</option><option value="turn">对话记录</option><option value="character_updated">角色设定修改</option></select><button id="exportEvents">导出完整操作日志</button></div><div id="eventList"></div><button id="moreEvents">加载更早记录</button></section></section><section id="diagnostics-panel-runtime" class="tab-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="diagnostics-tab-runtime" hidden><h2 id="operationsTitle">运行设置</h2><form id="cognitionForm" class="settings-form"><p class="fine">事前认知估计与证据审计；旧配置原值保存在兼容档案中。</p><label for="appraisalTimeout">单次事前评估最长时间（秒）</label><input id="appraisalTimeout" type="number" min="3" max="120" value="30"><p class="fine">资源上限只控制工作量。实验模式超过等待预算时保留消息，等待补充或手动重试，不强制发言。</p><button>保存认知路径</button></form><section class="settings-block"><h2>5 · 连续消息与回复时机</h2><form id="turnTakingForm"><label><input id="turnTakingEnabled" type="checkbox"> 聚合连续片段，由人格决定等待、回复或沉默</label><div class="two-col"><div><label for="turnDebounce">收到消息后先等多久（秒）</label><input id="turnDebounce" type="number" min="0.5" max="6" step="0.5"><label for="turnMaxWait">一轮最多等待（秒）</label><input id="turnMaxWait" type="number" min="6" max="15"></div><div><p class="fine">同一说话人的连续消息合成一轮；生成时收到补充会重新聚合。已经开始发送的 QQ 消息无法撤回。超长片段会保留并标为待处理。</p></div></div><button>保存回复时机</button><p class="fine">关闭聚合只跳过短暂收集时间，不关闭事前判断。等待预算结束不会直接转为回复。</p></form></section><section class="settings-block"><h2>2 · 回复速度与后台整理</h2><form id="performanceForm"><div class="two-col"><div><label for="performanceMode">回复流程</label><select id="performanceMode"><option value="balanced">前台实时状态 + 后台长期整理</option><option value="full">每轮完整同步流程</option></select><label><input id="performanceQQOnly" type="checkbox"> 仅 QQ 使用前台 / 后台流程</label><label for="replyChars">普通聊天回复预算（字符）</label><input id="replyChars" type="number" min="40" max="500"></div><div><label for="batchTurns">累计有效交互后整理（5–10 条）</label><input id="batchTurns" type="number" min="5" max="10"><label for="idleSeconds">空闲后整理（60–120 秒）</label><input id="idleSeconds" type="number" min="60" max="120"><label for="workChars">工作记录字符预算</label><input id="workChars" type="number" min="4000" max="100000"></div></div><p class="fine">情绪与衰减、当前会话、必要关系事件实时更新。明确纠正、重大冲突和复杂任务保留同步处理；内部协商的关闭 / 自动 / 始终设置继续有效。</p><div class="row"><button type="submit">保存回复流程</button><button id="consolidateNow" type="button">现在整理一批 / 重试失败项</button><button id="refreshConsolidation" type="button">刷新队列</button></div><pre id="consolidationStatus" class="compact-result"></pre></form></section></section></section></main></div>
